      "text": "PROMOTION DECISION WORKFLOW — DESKTOP\n\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ PROMOTION CANDIDATES — End of Academic Year          │\n│ Class: 3B → 4B    Term: Term 3 2025/26               │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ STUDENT REVIEW TABLE                                 │\n│ ┌──┬────────────┬──────┬──────┬──────┬──────┬──────┐ │\n│ │ #│ Student    │ Avg% │ Att% │ SBA% │ Rec. │ Dec. │ │\n│ ├──┼────────────┼──────┼──────┼──────┼──────┼──────┤ │\n│ │ 1│ Ama Asante │ 82%  │ 96%  │ 88%  │ PROM │ ☑ PROM│ │\n│ │ 2│ Kofi Mensah│ 68%  │ 89%  │ 72%  │ PROM │ ☑ PROM│ │\n│ │ 3│ Akua Owusu │ 75%  │ 94%  │ 78%  │ PROM │ ☑ PROM│ │\n│ │ 4│ Kwame Adjei│ 52%  │ 78%  │ 55%  │ REPEAT│ ☐ REP│ │\n│ │ 5│ Yaa Boateng│ 45%  │ 65%  │ 48%  │ REPEAT│ ☐ REP│ │\n│ └──┴────────────┴──────┴──────┴──────┴──────┴──────┘ │\n│ Auto-recommendation: Avg ≥ 55% & Att ≥ 80% & SBA ≥ 50% │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ DECISION PANEL (Select student → Review)             │\n│ ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────┐   │\n│ │ Kwame Adjei — RECOMMENDED: REPEAT              │   │\n│ │                                                │   │\n│ │ Academic: 52% (Below 55% threshold)           │   │\n│ │ Attendance: 78% (Below 80% threshold)         │   │\n│ │ SBA Completion: 55% (At threshold)            │   │\n│ │ Behaviour: 2 negative incidents this term     │   │\n│ │                                                │   │\n│ │ Teacher Comment: \"Struggles with math          │   │\n│ │ concepts, needs foundational reinforcement\"   │   │\n│ │                                                │   │\n│ │ Parent Meeting: 15 Jul 2026 (Scheduled)       │   │\n│ │                                                │   │\n│ │ DECISION: [PROMOTE] [REPEAT] [CONDITIONAL]    │   │\n│ │ Notes: [____________________________________]  │   │\n│ └────────────────────────────────────────────────┘   │\n├───────────────────────────